/span></a></section><div class=\"nav-scroll-fade-bar\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div></nav>\n    <div class=\"sidebar-bottom\"><div class=\"mini-membership\" data-settings-link-ready=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" aria-label=\"打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\" title=\"点击打开个人设置与⚙️ 账户与设置\"><div class=\"mini-avatar\" data-member-initial=\"\">演</div><div><span data-member-name=\"\">演示用户</span><small data-member-level=\"\">天使</small></div></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sidebar-resize-handle\" role=\"separator\" aria-orientation=\"vertical\" title=\"拖动调整菜单宽度\"></div></aside>\n  <main class=\"workspace-main\">\n    <header class=\"topbar\"><div class=\"topbar-left\"><button class=\"mobile-menu\" type=\"button\" data-open-sidebar=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div><span>SHORT LINKS</span><div class=\"page-heading-row\"><h1>我的短链接</h1><p class=\"page-intro\" data-page-note=\"\">为站内页面生成短链接，看是谁带来的访问。</p></div></div></div><div class=\"topbar-actions\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"global-search-trigger\" data-open-search=\"\" aria-label=\"打开全站搜索\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#search\"></use></svg><span>搜索</span><kbd>⌘K</kbd></button><a class=\"back-dashboard\" href=\"/creator-workbench/member/main.html\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#home\"></use></svg><span>返回我的工作台</span></a></div></header>\n    <div class=\"settings-content sm-shell\">\n      <section class=\"pm-hero\">\n        <div class=\"pm-hero-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20261012links#link\"></use></svg></div>\n        <div>\n          <span class=\"pm-eyebrow\">分享，让好内容被看见</span>\n          <h2>把长网址，变成好分享的短链接</h2>\n          <p>课程、活动、好内容，都可以轻松发给朋友。粘贴创作工作台的网址，生成短链接后复制，或用二维码分享。</p><ol class=\"sm-steps\" aria-label=\"分享的三个步骤\"><li><b>01</b>粘贴网址</li><li><b>02</b>生成短链接</li><li><b>03</b>复制分享</li></ol>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n      <p id=\"ms-status\" class=\"pm-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      <div id=\"ms-app\">\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\">\n          <header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"sm-section-number\">01</span>生成一条短链接</h2><p>先粘贴网址；名称和短码都可以留空，留空时会自动帮你取一个。</p></div></header>\n          <form id=\"ms-create\" class=\"sm-create-form\">\n            <label class=\"pm-field sm-wide\" for=\"ms-target\"><span>想分享哪个页面？ <span class=\"sm-required\">必填</span></span><input id=\"ms-target\" name=\"target\" type=\"url\" required=\"\" maxlength=\"1024\" autocomplete=\"off\" aria-describedby=\"ms-target-hint\" placeholder=\"粘贴完整网址，例如 https://www.wxgaochu.com/…\"><small id=\"ms-target-hint\">支持 wxgaochu.com 和 www.wxgaochu.com 下允许分享的页面；粘贴的链接如果带 __slref，会自动去掉。</small></label>\n            <label class=\"pm-field\" for=\"ms-title\"><span>给短链接取个名字 <span class=\"pm-muted\">选填</span></span><input id=\"ms-title\" name=\"title\" maxlength=\"200\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"例如：发给朋友的沙龙报名页\"><small class=\"sm-field-hint\">只在你自己这里显示，不写也没关系。</small></label>\n            <label class=\"pm-field\" for=\"ms-slug\"><span>自己设置短链接后面的字母 <span class=\"pm-muted\">选填</span></span><input id=\"ms-slug\" name=\"slug\" maxlength=\"32\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"none\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"例如 salon-1012\" aria-describedby=\"ms-slug-hint\"><small id=\"ms-slug-hint\">6–32 位，只能用英文小写字母、数字、短横线或下划线，并且至少包含其中两种（例如 salon-1012）。不填写就自动生成。</small></label>\n            <div class=\"sm-create-footer sm-wide\"><p>只需填写网址，其他信息都可以先不填。</p><button id=\"ms-submit\" class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"submit\">生成短链接 <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#arrow\"></use></svg></button></div>\n            <p id=\"ms-create-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"pm-status sm-wide\"></p>\n          </form>\n        </section>\n        <section class=\"settings-card pm-panel\">\n          <header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><h2><span class=\"sm-section-number\">02</span>我创建的短链接</h2><p>下次分享时，直接在这里复制。有效点击统计近30天的访问，不等于客户人数。</p></div></header>\n          <div class=\"sm-list-toolbar\"><label class=\"pm-field\" for=\"ms-search\">查找短链接<input id=\"ms-search\" type=\"search\" placeholder=\"输入名字、短码或网址\"></label><label class=\"pm-field\" for=\"ms-filter\">短链接状态<select id=\"ms-filter\"><option value=\"\">全部状态</option><option value=\"active\">使用中</option><option value=\"disabled\">已停用</option><option value=\"archived\">已归档</option></select></label><span id=\"ms-list-count\" class=\"sm-count\">共 0 条</span></div><div class=\"sm-table-wrap\"><table class=\"sm-table\"><thead><tr>\n            <th scope=\"col\">名称与短链接</th><th scope=\"col\">分享的页面</th><th scope=\"col\">状态</th><th scope=\"col\">近30天有效点击</th><th scope=\"col\">已归因订单</th><th scope=\"col\">操作</th>\n          </tr></thead><tbody id=\"ms-tbody\"></tbody></table></div>\n          <p class=\"sm-empty\" id=\"ms-empty\">还没有短链接。把网址粘贴到上方，试着生成第一条吧。</p>\n          <nav id=\"ms-pagination\" class=\"sm-pagination\" aria-label=\"短链接翻页\" hidden=\"\"></nav>\n        </section>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <dialog id=\"ms-result\" class=\"pm-dialog sm-result-dialog\" aria-labelledby=\"ms-result-title\">\n    <header class=\"pm-heading\"><div><span class=\"pm-eyebrow\">分享准备好了</span><h2 id=\"ms-result-title\">短链接生成好了，分享出去吧</h2></div><button class=\"sm-close\" type=\"button\" data-result-close=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭分享结果\">×</button></header>\n    <div class=\"pm-dialog-body\">\n      <p class=\"pm-muted\">复制短链接发给朋友，或者保存二维码分享。</p>\n      <label class=\"pm-field\">短链接<input id=\"ms-result-url\" readonly=\"\"></label>\n      <div class=\"sm-result-qr\"><img id=\"ms-result-image\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" alt=\"这条短链接的二维码\"><span>扫一扫，也能打开页面</span></div>\n      <p id=\"ms-copy-status\" class=\"pm-status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n      <div class=\"sm-result-actions\">\n        <button class=\"pm-btn pm-primary\" type=\"button\" id=\"ms-result-copy\">复制短链接</button>\n        <a class=\"pm-btn\" id=\"ms-result-qr\" href=\"#\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">查看 / 保存二维码</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n  <div class=\"workspace-toast\" id=\"workspace-toast\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n\n\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sidebar-restore\" data-sidebar-restore=\"\" aria-label=\"打开菜单\" title=\"打开菜单\"><svg><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#menu\"></use></svg></button><div class=\"nav-tooltip\" role=\"tooltip\"></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog\" data-global-search-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-search=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"global-search-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>GLOBAL SEARCH</span><h2 id=\"global-search-title\">全站搜索</h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-search=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭搜索\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <label class=\"global-search-field\">\n        <svg aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"/wxgc-member/icons.svg?v=20260907a#spark\"></use></svg>\n        <input type=\"search\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"搜索你感兴趣的任何内容吧\" aria-label=\"搜索关键词\">\n        <kbd>ESC</kbd>\n      </label>\n      <div class=\"global-search-status\">输入关键词，快速找到可以继续使用的内容。</div>\n      <div class=\"global-search-results\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div>\n    </section></div><div class=\"global-search-dialog daily-action-dialog\" data-daily-action-dialog=\"\" hidden=\"\">\n    <div class=\"global-search-backdrop\" data-close-daily=\"\"></div>\n    <section class=\"global-search-panel daily-action-panel\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-action-title\">\n      <header>\n        <div><span>DAILY CHECK-IN</span><h2 id=\"daily-action-title\">今日行动 <small class=\"daily-action-brand\">每日出摊</small></h2></div>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-close-daily=\"\" aria-label=\"关闭今日行动\">×</button>\n      </header>\n      <p class=\"daily-action-hint\">辛苦一天不容易，赶紧记一笔，再小的成果也是进步。</p>\n      <form data-daily-action-form=\"\" class=\"daily-action-form\">\n        <fieldset>\n          <legend>行动类型 <em class=\"required\">必填</em></legend>\n          <div class=\"daily-action-options\">\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_moments\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了条朋友圈</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"xhs_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇小红书</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_channels_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了视频号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_post\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>写了篇公众号</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"wechat_oa_card\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发布了公众号贴图</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"short_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了短视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"long_video\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>发了长视频</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"qa_answer\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>问答平台答了题</span>\n    </label>\n    <label class=\"daily-action-radio\">\n      <input type=\"radio\" name=\"daily-action-key\" value=\"client_followup\" data-daily-key-radio=\"\">\n      <span>聊了老客户</spa